# Feedback error form mobile

Error setelah **submit form** (login, OTP, usulan, laporan, dll.) harus
seragam lewat bottom sheet supaya layout tombol/field tidak bergeser.

## Wajib

- Form-level `errorMessage` / gagal submit → `showAppErrorSheet`
  (`mobile/lib/shared/utils/error_bottom_sheet.dart`).
- Picu lewat `ref.listen` (atau `await` di catch lokal), lalu `clearError`
  saat sheet ditutup supaya pesan yang sama bisa muncul lagi.
- `RATE_LIMITED`, sukses singkat, batal social → `showFToast`.
- `VALIDATION_ERROR` per-field → inline di field (bukan sheet penuh).
- Load gagal / empty list-halaman → `FAlert` atau empty state di body.

## Contoh

```dart
// ❌ BAD - FAlert sticky menggeser OTP / tombol submit
if (state.errorMessage != null)
  FAlert(variant: .destructive, title: Text(state.errorMessage!)),

// ✅ GOOD
ref.listen(provider.select((s) => s.errorMessage), (_, next) {
  if (next == null || !context.mounted) return;
  if (ref.read(provider).errorCode == 'RATE_LIMITED') {
    showFToast(context: context, title: Text(next));
    ref.read(provider.notifier).clearError();
    return;
  }
  showAppErrorSheet(context, message: next).whenComplete(() {
    if (context.mounted) ref.read(provider.notifier).clearError();
  });
});
```

